  "body": "Enjoy breathtaking panoramic sea views from this truly exceptional family home, set on a generous 1037m² (mol) section in one of the most prestigious streets of the Eastern Peninsula. Offering approximately 330m² (mol) of living space, this magnificent residence delivers the perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProudly positioned at the front of the section with a beautifully landscaped backyard and uninterrupted sea views, the home has been thoughtfully designed for both relaxed family living and effortless entertaining. From the kitchen and main living areas, the sea becomes part of your everyday life. Large windows and seamless indoor–outdoor flow open to a stunning courtyard and landscaped garden, perfectly positioned to capture the spectacular coastal outlook — an ideal setting to enjoy your morning coffee at sunrise or afternoon tea while watching the sunset over the water.\r\n\r\nThe home offers a fresh and modern living environment. A stylish designer kitchen, complete with a granite central island, quality appliances, and a built-in refrigerator, forms the heart of the home. This space connects effortlessly with the dining area and sun-filled family room. A separate elegant lounge, enhanced by chandeliers and quality furnishings, provides a refined yet comfortable space for entertaining or relaxing.\r\n\r\nThe ground level also features a double bedroom with ensuite, an office ideal for working from home, a separate toilet and laundry, central vacuum system, and a double internal-access garage, offering both practicality and flexibility for families and guests.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you will find three generous double bedrooms, including the master suite with a spacious ensuite featuring a spa bath and walk-in wardrobe. Elevated views from this room create a peaceful private retreat, while a well-appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property is fully fenced with an automatic gate, ensuring privacy, security, and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nLifestyle opportunities abound with Howick Golf Club at Musick Point just a short stroll away — perfect for golf enthusiasts. Eastern Beach, Bucklands Beach, and Half Moon Bay Marina are only a few minutes driving where you’ll find supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, gyms, pharmacies, and a wide range of local amenities. Whether for everyday convenience or enjoying coastal walks, kayaking, and swimming in the sea, outdoor lovers will appreciate the abundance of recreational options nearby.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also value the outstanding school zones, including the highly sought-after Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Bucklands Beach Primary School, which is just a 3-minute walk away. This location provides top-tier educational opportunities with exceptional convenience for growing families.\r\nThis remarkable property presents a rare opportunity to secure a luxury coastal home in one of East Auckland’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing, or join us at our open homes on Saturday, Sunday, and Wednesday.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctions welcome",
